:"2021-09-10T08:22:56Z","body":"We are discussing in the linux-man@ mailing list about renaming this license tag to `Linux-man-pages-copyleft` (or some other similar proposals), since the term \"Verbatim\" doesn't represent very well the license text.\r\n\r\nSee <https://lore.kernel.org/linux-man/8b513d06-3e9e-3d2f-6217-07bf2fa3765c@gmail.com/T/#m375aa0483debfd97a481e95dee57c4059cae9cb7>.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/916725215/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/917285337","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310#issuecomment-917285337","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310","id":917285337,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE842rKnZ","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-09-10T23:31:18Z","updated_at":"2021-09-10T23:31:18Z","body":"hi all - do I understand that we have already merged this, but we are also still kind of waiting to have a final decision on a name (given the above link)? In which case, should we have merged already? We certainly don't want it to look like short ids are changing even if it's not yet in an official release","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/917285337/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/917378917","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310#issuecomment-917378917","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310","id":917378917,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE842rhdl","user":{"login":"alejandro-colomar","id":21089465,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDg5NDY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21089465?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alejandro-colomar","html_url":"https://github.com/alejandro-colomar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alejandro-colomar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alejandro-colomar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alejandro-colomar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alejandro-colomar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alejandro-colomar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alejandro-colomar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alejandro-colomar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alejandro-colomar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alejandro-colomar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-09-11T09:57:13Z","updated_at":"2021-09-11T09:57:13Z","body":"The proposal for changing names came long after merging :/\r\n\r\nHowever, if you release with this name, no problem, we'll stick with it forever, and I'll reject the renaming proposal.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/917378917/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/919582308","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310#issuecomment-919582308","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310","id":919582308,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE842z7Zk","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-09-14T23:30:24Z","updated_at":"2021-09-14T23:30:24Z","body":"right... well, it's merged, but not part of an official release yet (3.15) and thus, not published on website yet\r\n\r\n@swinslow, @goneall  - what do you think about changing an SPDX id in this period? (given we try to not change them)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/919582308/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/919609523","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310#issuecomment-919609523","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310","id":919609523,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE8420CCz","user":{"login":"goneall","id":378172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3ODE3Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/378172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goneall","html_url":"https://github.com/goneall","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goneall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goneall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goneall/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goneall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goneall/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goneall/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goneall/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goneall/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goneall/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-09-15T00:41:10Z","updated_at":"2021-09-15T00:41:10Z","body":">  what do you think about changing an SPDX id in this period? (given we try to not change them)\r\n\r\n@jlovejoy really good question.  In my opinion, it would be OK to change it before a release.  Once released, however, it should never change.\r\n\r\nThere may be some who are watching the license-list-data repo and using the data as it merged that my get tripped up by this, however.  My personal opinion is that you should not depend on the data until it is released.\r\n\r\n@swinslow curious about your thoughts.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/919609523/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/922240819","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310#issuecomment-922240819","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310","id":922240819,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE842-Ecz","user":{"login":"pombredanne","id":675997,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NTk5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/675997?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne","html_url":"https://github.com/pombredanne","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pombredanne/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-09-18T08:32:08Z","updated_at":"2021-09-18T08:32:08Z","body":"> @swinslow, @goneall - what do you think about changing an SPDX id in this period? (given we try to not change them)\r\n\r\n@jlovejoy  I am all for it until released. That's why there are releases.\r\n\r\nAnd in particular, why using a `man-pages` references in this id? I reckon it was seen in man pages, but the license references only a \"manual\" not man pages which would be a specific format. It feels weird to reference a format in the id of a license.  `Verbatim-manual` would be a better id IMHO.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/922240819/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/927238200","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310#issuecomment-927238200","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310","id":927238200,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE843RIg4","user":{"login":"g-branden-robinson","id":91402745,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDAyNzQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91402745?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson","html_url":"https://github.com/g-branden-robinson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-09-26T05:49:24Z","updated_at":"2021-09-26T05:49:24Z","body":"I've submitted a PR for the rename.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/pull/1336","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/927238200/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/927238903","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310#issuecomment-927238903","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310","id":927238903,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE843RIr3","user":{"login":"g-branden-robinson","id":91402745,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDAyNzQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91402745?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson","html_url":"https://github.com/g-branden-robinson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g-branden-robinson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-09-26T05:55:00Z","updated_at":"2021-09-26T05:55:00Z","body":"> > @swinslow, @goneall - what do you think about changing an SPDX id in this period? (given we try to not change them)\r\n> \r\n> @jlovejoy I am all for it until released. That's why there are releases.\r\n> \r\n> And in particular, why using a `man-pages` references in this id? I reckon it was seen in man pages, but the license references only a \"manual\" not man pages which would be a specific format. It feels weird to reference a format in the id of a license. `Verbatim-manual` would be a better id IMHO.\r\n\r\n\"man-pages\" refers to the name of the originating project; it's not a reference to the documentation format per se, although the project has, to date, restricted its mission to the production of man pages.  \"Verbatim\" is a poor choice of terminology for reasons Alex and I discussed on the linux-man mailing list (there's a URL in my PR).  Briefly, it is difficult for a person to infer the right to distribute modified forms of a work from the word \"verbatim\", particularly in a copyright law context when that permission is reserved by default.\r\n\r\nAnother reason for this license name to be particular to the Linux man-pages project is that the quasi-warranty-disclaimer paragraph has language specific to \"the Linux kernel and libraries\".  This is not going to be appropriate language for many other projects.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/927238903/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/945290463","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310#issuecomment-945290463","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310","id":945290463,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE844V_zf","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-10-18T02:06:13Z","updated_at":"2021-10-18T02:06:13Z","body":"@goneall @jlovejoy Apologies for slow response. Reading through this, yes, I'm +1 with the idea that we'll be open to changing IDs as long as a merged ID has _not_ yet been in a release, or appeared on the public [license list page](https://spdx.org/licenses).\r\n\r\nOnce it's in a release and lands there, I think that makes sense as the point in time when our position of \"we'll deprecate but we never ever remove IDs\" kicks in.\r\n\r\nLooks like the CI hasn't run yet in #1336, I'm starting it now.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/945290463/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/954007258","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310#issuecomment-954007258","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1310","id":954007258,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE8443P7a","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-10-28T16:28:10Z","updated_at":"2021-10-28T16:28:10Z","body":"Discussed name change on 2021-10-28 legal team call, agreed to change ID to Linux-man-pages-copyleft; merged #1336. Thanks all!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/954007258/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]